{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If all the logarithms are real numbers, the equality\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e07b3ea21472644434490b5f13c2ace4669936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(x+3)+\\log(x-1)=\\log(x^2-2x-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"335\" height=\"21\" />\nis satisfied for:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/f/4bff3cca1a4e26a4fc3eb96ff27660f46ce5f4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) all real values of }x \\quad\\\\ \\text{(B) no real values of } x\\quad\\\\ \\text{(C) all real values of } x \\text{ except } x=0\\quad\\\\ \\text{(D) no real values of } x \\text{ except } x=0\\quad\\\\ \\text{(E) all real values of } x \\text{ except } x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"266\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the given we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/5/1f506a774fc52fe7ea88131c01fb3c5f3515901a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log(x+3)+\\log(x-1)=\\log(x^2-2x-3)\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1eedaa202b5117fd0d2ca10fa853ae762ca5bf43.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log(x^2+2x-3)=\\log(x^2-2x-3)\\]\" width=\"279\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/d/6cd45e9ecb70c334f2eafbee324601876c896bd9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+2x-3=x^2-2x-3\\]\" width=\"205\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5065ea42e71241d1571fd868bae3267c53d818.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=0\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\nHowever substituing into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee727902f327c2ee7dcfc54a86fa564eb4644462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> gets a negative argument, which is impossible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">